    "champ in the making!\p"
    "CELADON GYM's LEADER is ERIKA.\p"
    "She is a user of GRASS-type\n"
    "POKéMON, and at one with nature.\p"
    "She might appear docile because of\n"
    "her flower arranging…\p"
    "But she's not one to be taken\n"
    "lightly!$"
}

